sequenceDiagram
    participant Creator
    participant ReactApp
    participant MaterialAPI
    participant Admin
    participant Database

    Creator->>ReactApp: Upload material file
    ReactApp->>MaterialAPI: POST /api/materials
    MaterialAPI->>Database: Save file metadata Draft
    MaterialAPI-->>ReactApp: 201 Created
    Admin->>ReactApp: Open content review queue
    ReactApp->>MaterialAPI: PUT approve material
    MaterialAPI->>Database: Update status Published
    MaterialAPI->>Database: Create notification N03
    MaterialAPI-->>ReactApp: 200 OK
    ReactApp-->>Creator: Content approved notification
